  "description": "Hypervisor's view of the Incus platform on krg-nat (incus_*): per-instance and per-project CPU/memory/disk/network/filesystem, plus daemon health. This is the OUTSIDE view of every tenant instance — krg-nat sees them all without reaching into the NAT'd guests, so it works for instances the fleet Prometheus can't scrape directly. Pick a $project / $instance to scope. Complements KRG · Node Fleet (the in-guest node_exporter view, which tenant instances don't expose).",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [],
